  "id": "chocolate-orange-waffles",
  "name": "Chocolate Orange Waffles",
  "subtitle": "Crisp, cocoa-rich waffles with bright orange flavor",
  "description": "A simple chocolate waffle batter flavored with orange zest and essence, finished with chocolate and optional-style toppings as specified.",
